    "off_ar": "النشاط ورقي بالكامل، ولا يحتاج شاشة بعد الشرح.",
    "lead_en": "Groups of four. School situations on cards, and a thermometer from 1 to 5.",
    "rounds_en": [
     [
      "5 min",
      "Round 1",
      "Read each situation and place it on the thermometer: how angry does it make you? You will disagree — that is the point."
     ],
     [
      "5 min",
      "Round 2",
      "For each situation: which body sign would show up first?"
     ],
     [
      "5 min",
      "Round 3",
      "Take your hottest situation and write two different possible responses."
     ]
    ],
    "i_en": "Round one exists to surface the differences: the same situation lands at different temperatures for different people, and no answer is wrong. In round three, never accept a single response — insist on the second, even a weak one.",
    "m_en": "Scenario cards, the thermometer sheet, pens",
    "a_en": "For younger students: replace writing with pointing at the feeling faces drawn on the sheet.",
    "off_en": "The activity is entirely paper-based; after the briefing it needs no screen."
