    "i_en": "Five minutes to prepare on a small sheet, then the platform. Run the timer with friendly strictness — the limit is the teacher here. The audience cards keep every listener working, and they are your ready-made observation: four cards raised means the point landed.",
    "m_en": "The four audience cards per student, topic cards, a timer, the observation card (facilitator copy)",
