    "i_en": "Ten minutes to read and write, then they exchange cards and read. Circulate and read the cards as they are written; if you see a verdict on the person, stop it quietly and turn the writer back to the work. The thank-you is deliberate: it teaches that receiving feedback is a skill like giving it. Observe during the writing and the exchange.",
    "m_en": "The plan cards, blank feedback cards, pens, the observation card (facilitator copy)",
    "a_en": "Anyone who missed the plan session uses a ready sample plan. For a hesitant pair: start with the “keep” part alone until they warm up.",
    "off_en": "The activity is entirely paper-based; write the card's fields on the board.",
    "s_en": "The feedback stays between the two partners and is not read to the circle without the plan-owner's permission.",
