    "i_en": "Do not explain the point in advance. In round one, one or two groups will build with a single pair of hands — do not intervene. In round two, remind the Checker to measure. At comparison, ask one question: what changed once everyone had a role?",
    "m_en": "A4 paper (10 sheets per round per group), tape, role cards, a ruler to measure",
    "a_en": "For a group of three: the Coordinator also takes the Speaker role. For students who find handwork difficult: the Checker or Coordinator role.",
    "off_en": "The activity is entirely paper-based — it needs no technology at all.",
